<section id="S4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.5 </span>Results on DA-Code Benchmark</h3>

<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of <span id="S4.T3.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4C6EDB;">Co<span id="S4.T3.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#F58A7A;">D<span id="S4.T3.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4FB5A5;">A</span></span></span> against the DA-Agent on the DA-Code benchmark, where DA-Agent is powered by various LLMs including <span id="S4.T3.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">gemini-2.5-pro</span>, <span id="S4.T3.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">gpt-4o</span>, <span id="S4.T3.9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">gpt-4</span>, and <span id="S4.T3.9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">deepseek-coder</span>. Green shading marks the best within each group.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T3.10" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S4.T3.10.1" class="ltx_tr">
