<div id="lstnumberx267" class="ltx_listingline">If<span id="lstnumberx267.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx267.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>first<span id="lstnumberx267.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>figure<span id="lstnumberx267.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>is<span id="lstnumberx267.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>blank,<span id="lstnumberx267.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>that<span id="lstnumberx267.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>means<span id="lstnumberx267.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx267.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>code<span id="lstnumberx267.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>failed<span id="lstnumberx267.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="lstnumberx267.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>generate<span id="lstnumberx267.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>a<span id="lstnumberx267.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>figure.<span id="lstnumberx267.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Give<span id="lstnumberx267.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>a<span id="lstnumberx267.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>score<span id="lstnumberx267.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>of<span id="lstnumberx267.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>0<span id="lstnumberx267.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>on<span id="lstnumberx267.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx267.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Plot<span id="lstnumberx267.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>correctness.
